    dcterms:description "\\(\\textbf{Mole Degree Celsius} is a C.G.S System unit for 'Temperature Amount Of Substance' expressed as \\(mol-degC\\)."^^ns1:LatexString ;
    ns1:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS>,
