    ns1:latexDefinition """$AH = \\frac{\\mathcal{M}_\\omega}{\\vee_{net}}$,
where $\\mathcal{M}_\\omega$ is the mass of water vapor per unit volume of total air and $\\vee_{net}$ is water vapor mixture."""^^ns1:LatexString ;
