        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloCAL-PER-GM>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloJ-PER-KiloGM>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/KiloLB_F-FT-PER-LB>,
        <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/MegaJ-PER-KiloGM>,
